          </p>
          <p>
            The coating we apply bonds deeply to tile surfaces, sealing micro-cracks and pores that allow water ingress. You'll notice the difference immediately — a rich, uniform finish that makes the whole house look cared for. And with a coating that can last 10–15 years, it's one of the best-value home improvements you can make in Kilkenny.
          </p>
          <p>
            We work on concrete tiles, clay tiles, natural and fibre cement slates. If you're not sure whether your roof is suitable, just give us a call — we're always happy to advise honestly, even if the answer is that painting isn't right for you.
