          <span class="eyebrow">Service 02</span>
          <h3>Pressure Washing &amp; Biocide Treatment</h3>
          <p>
            Painting over a dirty roof is the number one cause of premature coating failure. That's why our preparation stage is thorough and non-negotiable. We pressure-wash your entire roof to remove moss, lichen, algae, dirt, and all loose or flaking material before we apply a single drop of coating.
          </p>
          <p>
            Following the pressure wash, we apply a professional-grade biocide treatment that kills any biological growth — including spores that aren't visible yet — right down to the root. Without this step, moss will regrow beneath the coating and lift it within a few years. With it, you get the clean substrate and the long-lasting result you're paying for.
